- # Search Page Rules

- Preserve documented flow: bootstrap (cache) → isochrone search → map/layout selection.
- Use `useSearchBootstrap`, `useIsochroneFlow`, `searchService.searchByPolygon` as integration points.
- Keep unified cache semantics keyed by preferences version intact.
- Maintain mobile vs desktop layout branching via `useMobile`.
- Respect pagination and tab behavior, including auto-switch after search.
